This is a placeholder. Put the Anthropic API key on this machine with:

  printf %s 'THE_REAL_KEY' > ~/.config/polytoken/secrets/anthropic
  chmod 600 ~/.config/polytoken/secrets/anthropic

Or run polytoken/bootstrap.sh and answer its prompt. Never put the real
value in this file or anywhere in git.

The key is the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from claude-env/.env (also in the dev Key
Vault as AnthropicApiKey per endpoints.json).
